// Search titles and descriptions for product pages, keyed by technical name.
// odoo-apps.json is regenerated by the store sync, so curated wording lives
// here. Every claim must match the product's own store description — for
// example, "for Odoo Community" is only used where the product says it fills
// a gap in Community. Products without an entry get the default template in
// productSeo().
